== 分式的乘方

根据乘方的意义，并且应用分式的乘法法则，我们很容易做分式的乘方。

例如：

$ (b/a)^2 = b/a dot b/a = b^2/a^2 #dou $

$ (b/a)^3 = b/a dot b/a dot b/a = b^3/a^3 #ju $

一般地有

$ (b/a)^n = underbrace(b/a dot b/a dots.c b/a, n "个") = (overbrace(b dot b dots.c b, n "个"))/(underbrace(a dot a dots.c a, n "个")) = b^n/a^n #ju $

// p.243
*分式乘方法则*：#edot[分式乘方，分子分母各自乘方]。即

$ (b/a)^n = b^n/a^n quad (n "是任意自然数") #ju $

#example("例 1")[计算：$ ((4b^3 x)/(3a^2))^3 #ju $]

#sol[$ ((4b^3 x)/(3a^2))^3 = (4b^3 x)^3/(3a^2)^3 = (64b^9 x^3)/(27a^6) #ju $]

#example("例 2")[计算：$ (-(3x^5 y^6)/(2a^3 b^4))^5 #ju $]

#sol[$ (-(3x^5 y^6)/(2a^3 b^4))^5 = (-1)^5 (3x^5 y^6)^5/(2a^3 b^4)^5 = -(243x^25 y^30)/(32a^15 b^20) #ju $]

#example("例 3")[计算：$ [-(x^2 y^3)/(3(x+y))]^4 dot ((x^2-y^2)/(x^2 y^2))^3 #ju $]

#sol[
$ & [-(x^2 y^3)/(3(x+y))]^4 dot ((x^2-y^2)/(x^2 y^2))^3 \
  &= +(x^8 y^12)/(81(x+y)^4) dot ((x+y)^3(x-y)^3)/(x^6 y^6) \
  &= (x^2 y^6 (x-y)^3)/(81(x+y)) #ju $
]

#attention[分式乘方时，如果分子分母是积的形式，应按照积的乘方法则进行。]

