== 分式的除法

在分数的除法里，我们知道，除以一个分数，等于乘以这个分数的倒数，例如 $2/3 div 4/5 = 2/3 times 5/4$。分式的除法，也依照分数除法的同样法则来进行。

*分式的除法法则*：#edot[一个代数式除以一个分式，等于乘以把这个分式的分子分母对调后所成的分式]。即

$ a/b div c/d = a/b times d/c #ju $

#example("例 1")[计算：

(1) $(3a^2 b^3)/(c^4 d) div (5a^2 b)/(c^3 d^2 x)$；　　　　(2) $(x^2-y^2)/(x^2+y^2) div (x^3-y^3)/(x^6+y^6)$。]

#sol[
(1) $ (3a^2 b^3)/(c^4 d) div (5a^2 b)/(c^3 d^2 x) &= (3a^2 b^3)/(c^4 d) times (c^3 d^2 x)/(5a^2 b) \
  &= (3a^2 b^3 c^3 d^2 x)/(5a^2 b c^4 d) = (3b^2 d x)/(5c) #fen $

(2) $ (x^2-y^2)/(x^2+y^2) div (x^3-y^3)/(x^6+y^6) &= (x^2-y^2)/(x^2+y^2) times (x^6+y^6)/(x^3-y^3) \
  &= ((x+y)(x-y)(x^2+y^2)(x^4-x^2 y^2+y^4))/((x^2+y^2)(x-y)(x^2+x y+y^2)) \
  &= ((x+y)(x^4-x^2 y^2+y^4))/(x^2+x y+y^2) #ju $
]

#example("例 2")[计算：

(1) $(x^2-4x)/(x+3) div (4-x)$；　　　　(2) $(3x+6) div (x^2+x-2)/x$。]

// p.245
#sol[
(1) $ (x^2-4x)/(x+3) div (4-x) &= (x^2-4x)/(x+3) times 1/(4-x) \
  &= (x(x-4))/((x+3)(4-x)) = -x/(x+3) #fen $

(2) $ (3x+6) div (x^2+x-2)/x &= (3(x+2))/1 times x/(x^2+x-2) \
  &= (3(x+2)x)/((x+2)(x-1)) = (3x)/(x-1) #ju $
]

#example("例 3")[计算：

(1) $(x^2-9)/(x^2-1) div (x^2-5x+6)/(x^2+5x-6) div (x^2+5x+6)/(x^2-5x-6)$；

(2) $(a^2-b^2)/(a^2+b^2) div (a^3-b^3)/(a^4+b^4) times (a^2+b^2)/(a+b)$。]

#sol[
(1) $ & (x^2-9)/(x^2-1) div (x^2-5x+6)/(x^2+5x-6) div (x^2+5x+6)/(x^2-5x-6) \
  &= ((x+3)(x-3))/((x+1)(x-1)) times (x^2+5x-6)/(x^2-5x+6) times (x^2-5x-6)/(x^2+5x+6) \
  &= ((x+3)(x-3)(x+6)(x-1)(x-6)(x+1))/((x+1)(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x+2)(x+3)) \
  &= ((x+6)(x-6))/((x-2)(x+2)) #fen $

(2) $ & (a^2-b^2)/(a^2+b^2) div (a^3-b^3)/(a^4+b^4) times (a^2+b^2)/(a+b) \
  &= (a^2-b^2)/(a^2+b^2) times (a^4+b^4)/(a^3-b^3) times (a^2+b^2)/(a+b) \
  &= ((a+b)(a-b)(a^4+b^4)(a^2+b^2))/((a^2+b^2)(a-b)(a^2+a b+b^2)(a+b)) \
  &= (a^4+b^4)/(a^2+a b+b^2) #ju $
]

// p.246
#exercise("5·9(1)")[
  计算：

  1. $(14x^2)/(27y^2) div (7x)/(9y)$。
