== 繁分式

我们前面所学到的分式，分子和分母都是整式。有时，我们也会遇到另外一种形式的分式。例如

$ (a/b)/c, quad a/(b/c), quad (a/b)/(c/d), quad (a + 1/a)/(a - 1/a) $

等等。在这种分式里，分子或分母本身是一个分式，我们把这样的分式，叫作*繁分式*。

繁分式实际上是分式除法的另一种写法，因此可利用分式除法的法则，把它化成普通分式（分子分母都是整式的分式）。这种变换的过程，叫作把繁分式化简。

#example("例 1")[化简繁分式：

(1) $((a+b)/c)/((a-b)/c)$；　(2) $(x + 1/a)/(x - 1/a)$；　(3) $a/(1 + 1/a)$；　(4) $(1 + 1/a)/a$。]

#sol[
(1) $ ((a+b)/c)/((a-b)/c) &= (a+b)/c div (a-b)/c \
  &= (a+b)/c times c/(a-b) = (a+b)/(a-b) #fen $

// p.250
(2) $ (x + 1/a)/(x - 1/a) &= (x + 1/a) div (x - 1/a) \
  &= (a x+1)/a div (a x-1)/a \
  &= (a x+1)/a times a/(a x-1) = (a x+1)/(a x-1) #fen $

(3) $ a/(1 + 1/a) &= a div (1 + 1/a) = a div (a+1)/a \
  &= a times a/(a+1) = a^2/(a+1) #fen $

(4) $ (1 + 1/a)/a = (1 + 1/a) div a = (a+1)/a times 1/a = (a+1)/a^2 #ju $
]

繁分式也可以应用分式的基本性质来化简，如

$ (1) quad ((a+b)/c)/((a-b)/c) = (((a+b)/c) times c)/(((a-b)/c) times c) = (a+b)/(a-b) #fen $

$ (2) quad (x + 1/a)/(x - 1/a) = ((x + 1/a) times a)/((x - 1/a) times a) = (a x+1)/(a x-1) #fen $

$ (3) quad a/(1 + 1/a) = (a times a)/((1 + 1/a) times a) = a^2/(a+1) #fen $

$ (4) quad (1 + 1/a)/a = ((1 + 1/a) times a)/(a times a) = (a+1)/a^2 #ju $

// p.251
#example("例 2")[化简：$ (2 + 1/(x-1) - 1/(x+1))/(x + x/(x^2-1)) #ju $]

#sol(label: [解 1])[应用分式除法化简：

$ (2 + 1/(x-1) - 1/(x+1))/(x + x/(x^2-1)) &= (2 + 1/(x-1) - 1/(x+1)) div (x + x/(x^2-1)) \
  &= (2(x-1)(x+1)+(x+1)-(x-1))/((x-1)(x+1)) div (x(x^2-1)+x)/(x^2-1) \
  &= (2x^2-2+x+1-x+1)/((x-1)(x+1)) div (x^3-x+x)/(x^2-1) \
  &= (2x^2)/((x-1)(x+1)) times ((x+1)(x-1))/x^3 = 2/x #ju $
]

#sol(label: [解 2])[应用分式的基本性质，把分子分母都乘以 $x^2-1$，得

$ (2 + 1/(x-1) - 1/(x+1))/(x + x/(x^2-1)) &= (2(x^2-1)+(x+1)-(x-1))/(x(x^2-1)+x) \
  &= (2x^2-2+x+1-x+1)/(x^3-x+x) = (2x^2)/x^3 = 2/x #ju $
]

#example("例 3")[化简：(1) $(c/b)/a$；(2) $c/(b/a)$。]

#sol[
(1) $ (c/b)/a = ((c/b) times b)/(a times b) = c/(a b) #dou $

// p.252
或 $ (c/b)/a = c/b div a = c/b times 1/a = c/(a b) #fen $

(2) $ c/(b/a) = (c times a)/((b/a) times a) = (a c)/b #dou $

或 $ c/(b/a) = c div b/a = c times a/b = (a c)/b #ju $
]

#attention[必须区别 $(c/b)/a$ 与 $c/(b/a)$，这两个式子不相等，不同之处是两条分数线的长短，较短的线是小括号，较长的线是大括号。]

#example("例 4")[化简：$ 1/(1 - (1+x)/(x - 1/x)) #ju $]

#sol[
$ 1/(1 - (1+x)/(x - 1/x)) &= 1/(1 - (1+x)/((x^2-1)/x)) = 1/(1 - (1+x) dot x/(x^2-1)) \
  &= 1/(1 - ((1+x) dot x)/((x+1)(x-1))) = 1/(1 - x/(x-1)) \
  &= 1/((x-1-x)/(x-1)) = 1 dot (x-1)/(-1) = 1-x #ju $
]

#example("例 5")[化简：$ 1/(1 + 1/(1 + 1/(1 + 1/x))) #ju $]

// p.253
#sol[
$ 1/(1 + 1/(1 + 1/(1 + 1/x))) &= 1/(1 + 1/(1 + 1/((x+1)/x))) = 1/(1 + 1/(1 + 1 dot x/(x+1))) \
  &= 1/(1 + 1/(1 + x/(x+1))) = 1/(1 + 1/((x+1+x)/(x+1))) \
  &= 1/(1 + 1 dot (x+1)/(2x+1)) = 1/(1 + (x+1)/(2x+1)) \
  &= 1/(((2x+1)+(x+1))/(2x+1)) \
  &= 1/((3x+2)/(2x+1)) = 1 dot (2x+1)/(3x+2) = (2x+1)/(3x+2) #ju $
]

